Restore two separate csv database files for Tom's and Missy's birthday
  and anniversary lists, each with an owner's column marked:

  m - Missy
  t - Tom
  b - Both

A  blank code will be assumed to be Missy's.
The code can have an 'x' added to indicate not to print it.

The new files are named:

  anniversaries-master.csv
  birthdays-master.csv

The management file will be named:

  ?

Its library file will be:

  lib/?

Start with the files in directory /orig-lists
